<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-GHEDINA WINS MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-GHEDINA WINS MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>WENGEN, Switzerland 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kristian Ghedina of Italy won a men's World Cup downhill on Saturday, according to unofficial results.  </p>
<p>Luc Alphand of France finished second, with Austria's Fritz</p>
<p>Strobl third.</p>
